1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,320
This is it. It's gotta be.

2
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:14,420
What'll it be? We have enough supplies to keep going, but turning back might not be a bad idea.

3
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:18,460
No. We press on. Everyone, check your gear.

4
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:19,400
You got it.

5
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:24,200
Rudy, I have a few extra scrolls here. Would you like some?

6
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,380
Please. I'll take a few healing spells if you don't mind.

7
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:28,820
Here.

8
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,760
Thank you. This will help.

9
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:35,500
We don't know what kind of guardian we're going to face in there, but we have more than enough firepower.

10
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:39,820
And I'll work as hard as I can to support you. You won't even need the scrolls.

11
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:45,500
Thanks, Roxy. I spook pretty easily, so I'm glad you have my back.

12
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:48,020
Of course. You can always count on me.

13
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:52,900
Okay. Are we all good to go?

14
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:54,880
Hey, Rudy.

15
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:55,960
What is it?

16
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:59,740
I hate to say this, especially given what we're about to do here.

17
00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:02,140
Okay, then I don't want you to.

18
00:01:02,780 --> 00:01:03,700
Oh, okay.

19
00:01:04,820 --> 00:01:07,760
I'm not letting him drop any bombshells before the big fight.

20
00:01:08,380 --> 00:01:09,640
I can wait until we get home.

21
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:12,320
Let's go.

22
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:12,380
Let's go.

23
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:13,320
Let's go.

24
